  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8cbe4b5134d11360a85dd8c4fc4e147, type: 2}
  pages:
  - region: r1_ashfall
    synopsis: The ash remembers what the city forgot. Something here is still breathing.
  - region: r2_verdant
    synopsis: Green, quiet, patient. The valley is waiting for someone to notice.
  - region: r3_dunes
    synopsis: The sand moves when no wind blows. Old doors sleep under it.
  - region: r4_frostveil
    synopsis: Cold keeps things. Ice keeps them longest.
  - region: r5_archive
    synopsis: Written, then drowned. The tide reads what the people forgot.
  - region: r6_fracture
    synopsis: The land broke here once. The pieces have not stopped listening.
  - region: r7_throne
    synopsis: An empty seat. A name nobody says.
  - region: s1_glasswood
    synopsis: Every tree is a window. Some of them look back.
  - region: s2_mirrorsea
    synopsis: The water shows a sky that is not this one.
  - region: s3_choir
    synopsis: They sang until something told them to stop.
  - region: k1_cinder
    synopsis: Another world. The same hand burned it.
  - region: k2_hollow_moon
    synopsis: They hid inside their moon. It was not deep enough.
  - region: k3_last_city
    synopsis: The last ones wrote on the walls. They wrote your name.
  - region: z1_seat
    synopsis: Every line ends here. Or starts.
